//   the implication is vacuous. In each constrained sampling branch, the helper
//   returns either EOS or a parser-valid next token; on the non-EOS path,
//   AppendConstrainedToken preserves parser validity.
// suffix: In the unconstrained-chunk branch, staying outside makes the suffix
//   invariant vacuous; entering on `<<` sets currentConstrainedOut to [], which
