//   and we add 1. ConstrainedStep, GroupBoostedConstrainedStep, and
//   PenalizedConstrainedStep each contribute 1 and we add 1. Breaking branches
//   occur only after the corresponding cost-bumping helper, so steps already
//   reflects consumed work.
// progress: UnconstrainedChunk appends at most stepsUsed tokens and we increase
//   steps by stepsUsed. CloseConstrainedSpan appends at most one token and we
//   increase steps by 1. ConstrainedStep either appends one token and steps
//   grows by 1 or breaks immediately on EOS. The group-boosted and penalized
//   branches sample one token, then AppendConstrainedToken appends exactly one
